abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a subject-disjoint benchmark of lightweight
  object detectors for visible driver-cue localization. It includes frozen
  RGB and NIR protocols, media-free authored annotations and split metadata,
  pinned configurations and dependencies, evaluation and publication tools,
  sanitized predictions, metrics, and publication artifacts. Licensed DMD
  and Drive&Act source media are not redistributed.
keywords:
  - driver monitoring
  - object detection
  - subject-disjoint evaluation
  - reproducible research
  - near-infrared imaging
  - lightweight neural networks
